{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_19_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_19","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_19_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_19","textTraditional":"八年春正月己卯，烝。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_19_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_19","textTraditional":"天王使家父來聘。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_19_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_19","textTraditional":"夏五月丁丑，烝。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_19_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_19","textTraditional":"秋，伐邾。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_19_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_19","textTraditional":"冬十月，雨雪。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_19_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_19","textTraditional":"祭公來，遂逆王后于紀。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_19_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_19","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_19_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_19","textTraditional":"八年春，滅翼。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_19_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_19","textTraditional":"隨少師有寵。楚鬬伯比曰：「可矣。讎有釁，不可失也。」","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_19_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_19","textTraditional":"夏，楚子合諸侯于沈鹿。黃、隨不會，使薳章讓黃。楚子伐隨，軍於漢、淮之間。季梁請下之：「弗許而後戰，所以怒我而怠寇也。」少師謂隨侯曰：「必速戰。不然，將失楚師。」隨侯禦之，望楚師。季梁曰：「楚人上左，君必左，無與王遇。且攻其右，右無良焉，必敗。偏敗，眾乃攜矣。」少師曰：「不當王，非敵也。」弗從。戰于速杞，隨師敗績。隨侯逸，鬬丹獲其戎車，與其戎右少師。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_19_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_19","textTraditional":"秋，隨及楚平。楚子將不許，鬬伯比曰：「天去其疾矣，隨未可克也。」乃盟而還。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_19_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_19","textTraditional":"冬，王命虢仲立晉哀侯之弟緡於晉。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_19_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_19","textTraditional":"祭公來，遂逆王后于紀，禮也。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}